{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act17d0_level_act17d0_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act17d0",
  "stageId": "act17d0_05",
  "title": "Supply Recovery Plan",
  "storyCode": "OD-5",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "78c836db3ffe18efb3a4d4aa3ee129a2e3d8499e3498250a5278a6c5c954be26",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "You can do it! Lord!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "Hnng... Grrrgh! Gah...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Almost! Just a little more!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "And... Hah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "It's up!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Well done!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "Yes... It's very impressive you can pull back this crossbow with your bare hands."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "Phew..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "What a design. You couldn't tell by looking at it that this crossbow has such tensile strength."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "It's a pretty ordinary crossbow. Most Sarkaz can lock it barehanded."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "A heavy crossbow with this kind of power... at least than one hundred meters, it won't be that different from a gun. It's just too much work."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "...And I already learned the hard way that bit about our physical differences."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "That zappy girl over there might be no weaker than me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "Are you talking about Liskarm? She's a Vouivre. They're a strong race, for sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "Right......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Why the sudden interest in these weapons?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "We're expecting a lot of fights soon, so it's time to think about what to do when we run out of ammo."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "Without bullets, my gun might as well be a paperweight."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "I don't think we can take them hand-to-hand when it comes to that. And our training and experience won't be enough either."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "How much do we have left?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "Not much over here. Not even four hundred rounds."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Let me show you something."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "Is this a... bullet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "It's a bullet that Rhodes Islander named Liskarm uses. They call it an 'etched bullet,' and it's apparently an extremely expensive commodity."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "Did you take it apart yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "What's it made of? What's the propellant?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "This chunk of crystal."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "Looks like an energy source. Is that a propellant or a warhead?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "A Laterano gunsmith once told me that every single etched bullet contains a miniature casting unit that matches up with the structure of a Laterano gun."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "That means it's not only the gun, but every etched bullet, is basically a caster's staff. That's why they're so expensive, and why they need such complicated Arts that only Sankta can make much use of them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "Other peoples go with easier ranged weapons."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "So Laterano is the name of the country, Sankta is the name of the race. Laterano people are not necessarily Sankta... Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "But that's real bad news about the bullets."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "Do we have any gun here that doesn't require those 'Originium Arts' to work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "I've never heard about those firearms that don't need Originium Arts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "(Sigh)..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "One step at a time. At least everybody can use explosives."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "Where did Kötz go with them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "They're in the basement. Still trying to fix the thing that looks like a radio transmitter."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "text": "We can't power the comm casting unit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "text": "It's a power problem?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "text": "Maybe... I'll have to see."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "text": "Okay, you all take a step back. The valedictorian is about to do her stuff."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "text": "...Charging..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Oh! Ooh! Oooh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Was that Arts? It was pretty cool."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "It definitely... leaves an impression."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "text": "Is it working?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "text": "It's on!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "text": "Great work. That's my walking power supply."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "text": "Don't you have anything better to do than annoy me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "text": "......Hmm......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "text": "No good. It's still not connecting."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "text": "The crystal electronics unit may be too damaged. Or there may be some damage somewhere else in the circuit we can't see with the naked eye."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "text": "We don't have any equipment for repairing Originium circuits here, so we can't troubleshoot."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "text": "*Sigh*, sounds pretty hopeless."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "Can ordinary people do these Originium Arts too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "text": "Theoretically... almost anyone can learn to do Arts at some level, with enough training."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "text": "It's just that studying Arts takes time and effort, and that gets tied up pretty close with talent."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "text": "Lots of people master only the most basic Arts, even after pushing themselves a lot harder than others."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "I'm a dumb old man, and I've never learned any Originium Arts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "What are you thinking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "Nothing... Just brainstorming about our situation here... some wild, impractical ideas."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "text": "Oh, right, Mr. Kötz."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "text": "Take a look at this shield here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "What's... what's that on the shield?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "text": "I installed a high-powered spotlight and a universal Originium circuit based on the original design and function of your shield. It should work just like you're used to."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "Thanks a bundle!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "...Oh... But I can't use 'Originium Arts'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "text": "Strictly speaking, a universal Originium circuit is a piece of modern technology that lets people who don't know how to use Arts use it anyway. It is loaded with a few simple Originium Arts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "text": "Of course, the power supply and equipment maintenance still need to be carried out by a trained caster."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "All right, let's see. It's still pretty heavy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "...Turn it on... Hit the switch..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "All good. I'll give it a try."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "Wow! It really works!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "But it'll take some getting used to."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "I haven't done a shield charge in six months. I've almost forgotten how to use the thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "How are things looking outside?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "The last attack was also the last enemy movement. We haven't seen any probing strikes since. I don't think that's a good sign."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "Especially considering what a well-organized bunch of punks they are, I've got a bad feeling about this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "The calm before the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "Sure enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Where's the doctor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "Resting. He hasn't slept in days."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "Give the kid a break."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "He shouldn't have to deal with all this at his age."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "And we've got another problem on our hands. We're running out of food."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Right. Mr. Occphen told us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "What are you thinking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "I'm thinking whether or not we should take a trip back to the Infected quarter."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "I get you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "Oh? You have a plan?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "We left in a hurry. A lot of the sick people didn't have time to bring their food from home."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "True. We have enough hands here. We could send some people out to get supplies."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Then let's save our talk here. We should be able to get there before the night falls."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
